{%- doc -%}
  The Foot Tree mark (the foot-and-tree glyph from the logo) as inline SVG, painted in currentColor so the
  caller sets the colour with `color` and the size with width. Used as the small glyph over a heading and
  as the hero / corporate-band watermark on the Our Story page.

  The outline is the "Logo / Mark" component from the client's Figma (1000 x 900 artboard) - the same
  drawing as the library file foot-tree-favicon.png, kept as vector so it can take any colour and stay
  sharp at 940px. Nothing here is a new drawing. The hero and the corporate band also accept an uploaded
  "Watermark image" in its place.

  @param {string} [class_name] - CSS class for the <svg>
